551
00:41:52,178 --> 00:41:55,812
إِذا نودِيَ لِلصَّلاةِ مِن يَومِ الجُمُعَةِ فَاسعَوا إِلىٰ ذِكرِ اللَّهِ

552
00:41:56,012 --> 00:42:01,510
If you hear the call of prayer in the day of Jumu'ah(جُمعه) go to and fulfill the order of Allahسُبحانه وتعالى .

553
00:42:02,217 --> 00:42:08,677
So this person would disobey Allahسُبحانه وتعالى to follow his ration of this materialistic world.

554
00:42:09,833 --> 00:42:11,878
So we have to have Tawakul(توكل),

555
00:42:11,965 --> 00:42:17,338
Tawakul(توكل) simply put is these two Ahadith(احاديث)

556
00:42:17,537 --> 00:42:18,420
one Hadith(حديث) is;

557
00:42:18,727 --> 00:42:20,344
 عقلها وتوكل

558
00:42:21,690 --> 00:42:24,551
A companion came to Rasool Allah ﷺ and asked him about his camel.

559
00:42:24,581 --> 00:42:28,435
He said: When I come in, should I leave my camel untied and go in and pray.

560
00:42:29,949 --> 00:42:30,792
Is that Tawakul(توكل)?

561
00:42:31,089 --> 00:42:32,552
Rasool Allah ﷺ said: No.

562
00:42:33,116 --> 00:42:37,016
Tie your camel first and then have Tawakul(توكل) on Allah.

563
00:42:37,294 --> 00:42:38,668
This Hadith(حديث) is two words

564
00:42:39,088 --> 00:42:41,699
but look at the deep meaning that it gives of Tawakul(توكل).

565
00:42:42,556 --> 00:42:46,581
Tie your camel and then Tawakul Al Allah(توكل على الله).

566
00:42:46,740 --> 00:42:48,073
And then put your trust in Allah.

567
00:42:48,716 --> 00:42:55,483
In other words, you fulfill the means possible, in this world, you do your best,

568
00:42:55,729 --> 00:42:56,999
you tie the camel

569
00:42:57,515 --> 00:42:59,420
 because that is something in your control.

570
00:42:59,681 --> 00:43:01,317
You can control tying the camel,

571
00:43:01,880 --> 00:43:04,987
but then you leave the other things that are not under your control

572
00:43:05,017 --> 00:43:08,400
you leave them to Allahسُبحانه وتعالى and you put your trust in Allah.

573
00:43:09,130 --> 00:43:11,421
You do not control the other factors.

574
00:43:12,083 --> 00:43:13,500
You do not control the weather.

575
00:43:13,635 --> 00:43:18,302
You do not control; if somebody will come and steal the camel you don't have control those things.

576
00:43:18,714 --> 00:43:22,768
But you don't live in terror and paranoia because of those things.

577
00:43:22,994 --> 00:43:23,371
No.

578
00:43:23,450 --> 00:43:27,493
You are confident because you did your part but you leave the rest on Allah.

579
00:43:28,949 --> 00:43:29,798
The other Hadith(حديث);

580
00:43:30,179 --> 00:43:36,356
أَنَّكُمْ تَوَكَّلْتُمْ عَلَى اللَّهِ حَقَّ تَوَكُّلِهِ لَرَزَقَكُمْ كَمَا يَرْزُقُ الطَّيْرَ، تَغْدُوا خِمَاصاً وَتَرُوْحُ بِطَاناً

581
00:43:37,070 --> 00:43:39,070
If you have the right Tawakul(توكل) on Allah,

582
00:43:39,205 --> 00:43:44,134
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى would provide for you like he's providing for the birds.

583
00:43:44,778 --> 00:43:48,000
They leave in the morning hungry, they come back at night full.

584
00:43:48,985 --> 00:43:51,183
If you have the right Tawakul Al Allah(توكل على الله), he is gonna provide for you.

585
00:43:51,461 --> 00:43:55,283
The bird leaves in the morning hungry, it doesn't have a refrigerator.

586
00:43:55,791 --> 00:43:59,608
It doesn't have a storage, it does not have a bank account.

587
00:43:59,931 --> 00:44:06,686
We have bank accounts that have enough money to feed us for the rest of our lives and the lives of our children and our grandchildren

588
00:44:06,813 --> 00:44:12,229
and we are still afraid and we still have fear in our hearts

589
00:44:13,142 --> 00:44:16,341
and we're still not fulfilling the commandments of Allahسُبحانه وتعالى

590
00:44:16,547 --> 00:44:19,977
because we're afraid that we're going to starve to death because of hunger,

591
00:44:20,200 --> 00:44:26,311
even though we have enough money to feed ourselves and our descendants for generations.

592
00:44:26,794 --> 00:44:29,223
I mean, how much food do you need to survive?

593
00:44:29,516 --> 00:44:33,119
Seven dates a day multiply seven by 365 days a year.

594
00:44:33,453 --> 00:44:39,749
You need a jar of oil, olive oil and you need 365 loaves of bread

595
00:44:40,146 --> 00:44:44,035
and you need to have a storage a few barrels of water and that's it.

596
00:44:44,189 --> 00:44:50,090
You can live and survive and that's gonna cost $100, $200.

597
00:44:51,724 --> 00:44:53,996
We have 1000s and 1000s in our account.

598
00:44:54,893 --> 00:45:00,608
So Rasool Allah ﷺ says: If you have the Tawakul(توكل) on Allah; you would be fed and provided by Allah.

599
00:45:00,912 --> 00:45:04,262
Like the birds when they leave in the morning and they come at night full.

600
00:45:04,727 --> 00:45:06,171
Who's providing for them? Allah.

601
00:45:06,618 --> 00:45:08,435
But notice there's something else in the Hadith(حديث).

602
00:45:10,558 --> 00:45:14,868
The people who take the understanding of Tawakul(توكل) to the extreme, they missed this point.

603
00:45:15,987 --> 00:45:19,268
This other thing that would balance the understanding of Tawakul(توكل) is that

604
00:45:19,586 --> 00:45:21,769
the birds did not stay in their nest.

605
00:45:22,380 --> 00:45:25,162
They went out in the morning and they came out back at night.

606
00:45:25,343 --> 00:45:26,732
They were working all day.

607
00:45:27,606 --> 00:45:33,421
The birds, they did not stay in their nests from morning till night.

608
00:45:34,333 --> 00:45:35,793
Allah will not feed them that way.

609
00:45:36,039 --> 00:45:39,055
They had to leave early in the morning and they came back at sunset.

610
00:45:39,673 --> 00:45:43,231
So, they did a lot of work but then Allahسُبحانه وتعالى did provide for them.

611
00:45:43,775 --> 00:45:46,371
And this is the understanding and this is the concept of Tawakul(توكل).

612
00:45:47,466 --> 00:46:03,597
وَيا قَومِ لا يَجرِمَنَّكُم شِقاقي أَن يُصيبَكُم مِثلُ ما أَصابَ قَومَ نوحٍ أَو قَومَ هودٍ أَو قَومَ صالِحٍ ۚ وَما قَومُ لوطٍ مِنكُم بِبَعيدٍ۝

613
00:46:03,657 --> 00:46:11,686
And O my people let not my Shiqaaq(شقاق) cause you to suffer the fate similar to that of the people of Nuh(نوح) or Hud(هود) or Saleh(صالح)

614
00:46:12,146 --> 00:46:15,210
and the people of Lut(لوط) are not far off from you.

615
00:46:16,239 --> 00:46:22,355
The people of Shoaib(شُعَيب) were despising Shoaib(شُعَيب), they hate Shoaib عليه السّلام.

616
00:46:24,077 --> 00:46:25,441
They disliked him.

617
00:46:26,314 --> 00:46:27,870
Syedina Shoaib(سَيِّدِنَا شُعَيْب) was telling them;

618
00:46:28,298 --> 00:46:34,772
Do not cause this personal problem that you have with me, prevent you from the truth and your salvation.

619
00:46:35,922 --> 00:46:42,152
Just because you dislike me, just because you have developed a sour relationship with me

620
00:46:42,698 --> 00:46:45,957
doesn't mean that you should prevent yourself from this good,

621
00:46:46,119 --> 00:46:47,896
this good belongs to Allah it’s not mine.

622
00:46:49,296 --> 00:46:53,845
This is what caused the Yahood(يهود) in Madina to disbelieve in Rasool Allah ﷺ

623
00:46:53,875 --> 00:46:55,694
because Rasool Allah ﷺ was not a Jew.

624
00:46:57,837 --> 00:47:01,853
They threw themselves in hellfire because Rasool Allah ﷺ was not one of them.

625
00:47:02,555 --> 00:47:09,056
Jealousy and hatred prevented them from the truth even though they knew that he is the messenger of Allah.

626
00:47:09,516 --> 00:47:14,341
Shoaib(شُعَيب) was telling them: Don't make this thing between us, prevent you from being Muslim

627
00:47:15,407 --> 00:47:23,081
and don't let this between us, cause the same fate of Hud(هود) and Saleh(صالح) and other nations

628
00:47:23,141 --> 00:47:25,415
don't let the fate that happened to them happen to you.

629
00:47:25,515 --> 00:47:28,106
Just because you don't get along with me.

630
00:47:28,502 --> 00:47:29,203
And then he told them;

631
00:47:29,233 --> 00:47:30,945
وَما قَومُ لوطٍ مِنكُم بِبَعيدٍ۝

632
00:47:31,142 --> 00:47:33,217
And the people of Lut(لوط) are not far away from you.

633
00:47:33,290 --> 00:47:39,202
The Muffasireen(مفسرين) say, this could either mean, these two meanings.

634
00:47:39,924 --> 00:47:41,378
وَما قَومُ لوطٍ مِنكُم بِبَعيدٍ۝

635
00:47:41,408 --> 00:47:43,386
 And the people of Lut(لوط) are not far away from you,

636
00:47:43,783 --> 00:47:46,918
either they're not far away from you in terms of distance

637
00:47:47,434 --> 00:47:52,775
and that's true because the people of Madyan(مَدْيَن) were close from the people of Lut(لوط) in terms of proximity; distance.

638
00:47:53,253 --> 00:47:56,138
The second meaning is that we're not far away in terms of time.

639
00:47:56,742 --> 00:47:59,121
So they're were not far apart in terms of time.

640
00:48:00,430 --> 00:48:02,843
Either one of these meaning could be right or both of them.

641
00:48:04,148 --> 00:48:07,457
So they knew the fate of the people of Lut(لوط) they knew what happened to Lut(لوط)

642
00:48:07,640 --> 00:48:10,044
nevertheless, they did not believe and then he said;

643
00:48:10,319 --> 00:48:19,349
وَاستَغفِروا رَبَّكُم ثُمَّ توبوا إِلَيهِ ۚ إِنَّ رَبّي رَحيمٌ وَدودٌ۝

644
00:48:19,437 --> 00:48:24,454
Seek forgiveness from Allah and this is the advice that every Nabi(نَبِي) has given to his followers.

645
00:48:24,740 --> 00:48:26,121
Ask Allah for forgiveness.

646
00:48:26,425 --> 00:48:27,391
So we all say;

647
00:48:27,470 --> 00:48:28,587
نستغفرالله العظيم

648
00:48:28,629 --> 00:48:30,988
O Allahسُبحانه وتعالى forgive us all for our sins.

649
00:48:32,327 --> 00:48:35,200
They threatened Shoaib عليه السّلام, they said;

650
00:48:36,009 --> 00:49:00,240
وَقالَ المَلَأُ الَّذينَ كَفَروا مِن قَومِهِ لَئِنِ اتَّبَعتُم شُعَيبًا إِنَّكُم إِذًا لَخاسِرونَ۝

651
00:49:00,288 --> 00:49:03,496
The chiefs; see the chiefs, always the trouble comes from the leadership.

652
00:49:03,891 --> 00:49:08,485
The Chiefs of those, who disbelieved among his people said to their people;

653
00:49:08,652 --> 00:49:12,501
If you follow Shoaib(شُعَيب), be sure then you will be of the losers.

654
00:49:12,979 --> 00:49:16,303
They started telling the people don't follow Shoaib(شُعَيب), otherwise you would lose.

655
00:49:18,652 --> 00:49:20,904
The punishment of Allahسُبحانه وتعالى came on them.

656
00:49:20,964 --> 00:49:34,693
فَأَخَذَتهُمُ الرَّجفَةُ فَأَصبَحوا في دارِهِم جاثِمينَ۝

657
00:49:34,783 --> 00:49:38,404
So the earthquake seized them and they lay dead prostrate in their homes.

658
00:49:38,717 --> 00:49:44,071
The Mufassireen(مفسرين) say, the punishment of the people of Shoaib(شُعَيب) happened this way.

659
00:49:45,183 --> 00:49:51,842
Clouds came over their heads and then the wind stopped.

660
00:49:52,270 --> 00:49:56,235
So the air seized to move it was still

661
00:49:57,584 --> 00:49:58,552
that was a punishment,

662
00:49:59,409 --> 00:50:06,374
because without air circulation humidity builds up the air is stuffy and hot.

663
00:50:07,226 --> 00:50:10,159
They were living under that air for days.

664
00:50:10,580 --> 00:50:13,612
The earth is still it's not moving at all, no breeze.

665
00:50:14,294 --> 00:50:18,199
This is a condition that we could never go through because it never happens always air is moving.

666
00:50:18,881 --> 00:50:23,966
But imagine air is still it's not moving at all and humidity is building up and clouds over their heads.

667
00:50:24,061 --> 00:50:32,061
So it's filled with humidity and that was a preparation for the punishment of the earthquake that came and shook them and destroyed them all.

668
00:50:32,154 --> 00:50:33,231
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

669
00:50:33,261 --> 00:50:45,550
الَّذينَ كَذَّبوا شُعَيبًا كَأَن لَم يَغنَوا فيهَا ۚ

670
00:50:45,847 --> 00:50:50,026
Those who belied Shoaib(شُعَيب), became as if they had never lived here before.

671
00:50:51,114 --> 00:50:57,515
After that earthquake, you come and see the town of Madyan(مَدْيَن), it looks like a ghost town as if nobody was living there before.

672
00:50:58,767 --> 00:51:03,716
This financial district so as to say, or financial centre became nothing.

673
00:51:05,240 --> 00:51:08,859
الَّذينَ كَذَّبوا شُعَيبًا كانوا هُمُ الخاسِرينَ۝

674
00:51:08,889 --> 00:51:09,717
Allah Akbar(ألله أكبر).

675
00:51:10,503 --> 00:51:13,590
Those who belied Shoaib(شُعَيب) they were the losers.

676
00:51:14,533 --> 00:51:19,120
The leaders were saying; If you follow Shoaib(شُعَيب) you would be of those, who are losers.

677
00:51:19,678 --> 00:51:20,768
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

678
00:51:20,826 --> 00:51:23,914
Those, who disbelieved in Shoaib(شُعَيب) they were the losers.

679
00:51:25,803 --> 00:51:26,803
And he said;

680
00:51:27,327 --> 00:51:57,866
فَتَوَلّىٰ عَنهُم وَقالَ يا قَومِ لَقَد أَبلَغتُكُم رِسالاتِ رَبّي وَنَصَحتُ لَكُم ۖ فَكَيفَ آسىٰ عَلىٰ قَومٍ كافِرينَ۝

681
00:51:58,008 --> 00:52:05,416
When they were dead Shoaib(شُعَيب) looked at their bodies and started speaking to their dead bodies.

682
00:52:05,956 --> 00:52:06,821
Shoaib(شُعَيب) said;

683
00:52:07,139 --> 00:52:15,887
O my people, I have indeed conveyed my Lord's message unto you and I have given you good advice.

684
00:52:16,454 --> 00:52:20,403
He's telling his people when they're dead, I have fulfilled my mission.

685
00:52:20,760 --> 00:52:27,451
I have done my part and Allah has fulfilled His Promise on me, and He has fulfilled His promise on you.

686
00:52:28,244 --> 00:52:31,458
I have conveyed the message to you and you refuse to follow it

687
00:52:31,561 --> 00:52:32,506
and then he said;

688
00:52:32,897 --> 00:52:36,357
فَكَيفَ آسىٰ عَلىٰ قَومٍ كافِرينَ۝

689
00:52:36,589 --> 00:52:41,112
Then how can I feel sorry for the disbelieving people.

690
00:52:42,747 --> 00:52:46,433
He's looking at their dead bodies and he is telling them I have no sorrow for you.

691
00:52:47,395 --> 00:52:47,973
Why?

692
00:52:47,997 --> 00:52:52,459
Because how can I have sorrow in my heart for the disbelievers.

693
00:52:53,531 --> 00:52:56,769
The ones, who displeased Allah I am displeased with them,

694
00:52:56,968 --> 00:53:00,801
the ones whom Allahسُبحانه وتعالى was angry with, I despise them,

695
00:53:01,071 --> 00:53:03,055
and I have no sorrow for you.

696
00:53:03,997 --> 00:53:06,094
This is the story of Syedina Shoaib(سَيِّدِنَا شُعَيْب).

697
00:53:06,626 --> 00:53:16,870
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى as we mentioned, has given Ibrahim عليه السّلام, the glad tidings of Is'haq(إسحاق) and Yaqub(يعقوب)

698
00:53:18,370 --> 00:53:20,702
and Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says about Is'haq(إسحاق),

699
00:53:21,180 --> 00:53:24,335
وَبَشَّرْنَاهُ بِإِسْحَاقَ نَبِيًّا مِنَ الصَّالِحِينَ۝

700
00:53:25,421 --> 00:53:30,074
And we gave him the glad tidings of Is'haq(إسحاق) a Prophet and of the righteous

701
00:53:32,677 --> 00:53:33,868
and Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

702
00:53:33,898 --> 00:53:36,063
وَبَشَّرُوهُ بِغُلَامٍ عَلِيمٍ۝

703
00:53:36,695 --> 00:53:40,269
And we have given him the glad tidings of a knowledgeable child.

704
00:53:41,857 --> 00:53:45,670
So Allah has described Is'haq(إسحاق) as being knowledgeable Aleem(عليم)

705
00:53:45,700 --> 00:53:50,563
and Allahسُبحانه وتعالى described him as being Minas-Saliheen(من الصالحين) a righteous

706
00:53:50,888 --> 00:53:52,210
and Allahسُبحانه وتعالى said;

707
00:53:52,377 --> 00:53:53,702
 كان نبيًا

708
00:53:54,011 --> 00:53:55,107
He is a prophet.

709
00:53:55,726 --> 00:54:05,003
Ishaq عليه السّلام had a child and that child is Sayidina Yaqub(سيدنا يعقوب).

710
00:54:06,812 --> 00:54:12,973
Yaqoob عليه السّلام has another name also, and that is Israel(اسرائيل).

711
00:54:13,633 --> 00:54:17,296
إِلّا ما حَرَّمَ إِسرائيلُ عَلىٰ نَفسِهِ مِن قَبلِ أَن تُنَزَّلَ التَّوراةُ ۗ

712
00:54:17,621 --> 00:54:21,469
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى has mentioned, the name Israel(اسرائيل) in the Qur'an

713
00:54:22,564 --> 00:54:26,526
and the Mufasireen(مفسرين) say that Israel(اسرائيل) means Abdullah(عبدالله),

714
00:54:26,756 --> 00:54:29,978
the servant of Allah, that's the explanation that they give to the word Israel(اسرائيل).

715
00:54:31,323 --> 00:54:37,128
So when we say Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل) the children of Israel(اسرائيل), we're talking about the sons of Yaqoob(يعقوب)

716
00:54:38,652 --> 00:54:45,317
and when we talk about the 12 tribes, we're talking about the tribes that are the descendants of the 12 Sons of Yaqoob(يعقوب).

717
00:54:45,563 --> 00:54:48,135
Yaqoob عليه السّلام had 12 sons.

718
00:54:51,834 --> 00:54:55,945
The best of them is Yusuf عليه السّلام.

719
00:54:57,374 --> 00:55:00,584
Who is a Nabi(نَبِي) of Allahسُبحانه وتعالى.

720
00:55:01,243 --> 00:55:05,664
Some scholars tend to believe that the other 11 brothers will also Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء)

721
00:55:07,378 --> 00:55:11,624
and they use as an evidence to support that the fact that Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

722
00:55:12,113 --> 00:55:24,361
قُولُوٓاْ ءَامَنَّا بِٱللَّهِ وَمَآ أُنزِلَ إِلَيْنَا وَمَآ أُنزِلَ إِلَىٰٓ إِبْرَٰهِۦمَ وَإِسْمَٰعِيلَ

723
00:55:24,599 --> 00:55:36,675
 وَإِسْحَٰقَ وَيَعْقُوبَ وَٱلْأَسْبَاطِ وَمَآ أُوتِىَ مُوسَىٰ وَعِيسَىٰ وَمَآ أُوتِىَ ٱلنَّبِيُّونَ مِن رَّبِّهِمْ

724
00:55:37,025 --> 00:55:45,258
لَا نُفَرِّقُ بَيْنَ أَحَدٍۢ مِّنْهُمْ وَنَحْنُ لَهُۥ مُسْلِمُونَ۝

725
00:55:45,361 --> 00:55:48,772
This Ayah(آية) is saying that we believe in what has been revealed to.

726
00:55:48,831 --> 00:55:53,450
And it mentions the names of Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم) and obviously revelation is given to the Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء).

727
00:55:53,801 --> 00:55:58,906
Ibrahim(اِبْراهِيْم), Ismail(اِسْماعِيْل), Is'haq(إسحاق), Yaqoob(يعقوب) and Al-Asbat(ألأسباط)

728
00:56:00,938 --> 00:56:03,542
and what was given to Eesa(عيسى) and Musa(موسى).

729
00:56:04,208 --> 00:56:08,811
So they say that Al-Asbat(ألأسباط) is talking about the 12 Son of Yaqoob(يعقوب)

730
00:56:10,804 --> 00:56:12,909
but the others Scholars respond and say;

731
00:56:12,939 --> 00:56:13,257
 No.

732
00:56:13,352 --> 00:56:19,077
Al-Asbat(ألأسباط) does not mean the 12 Sons of Yaqoob(يعقوب) but it means the 12 tribes

733
00:56:19,569 --> 00:56:27,044
and Allahسُبحانه وتعالى combined them all in the word Al-Asbat(ألأسباط) to include all of the prophets that came in the 12 tribes; of Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل).

734
00:56:27,313 --> 00:56:33,738
Because we know that many, many prophets were sent to the children of Israel(اسرائيل), and they were among the 12 tribes.

735
00:56:34,008 --> 00:56:39,669
Therefore Al-Asbat(ألأسباط) over here is not referring to the fathers of the tribes but it's referring to all the tribes

736
00:56:39,828 --> 00:56:43,673
and Ibn Kathir(اِبْنِ كَثِيْر) supports this opinion because he says that

737
00:56:43,712 --> 00:56:48,908
the things that were done by the brothers of Yusuf(يوسف) are not appropriate for the Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء).

738
00:56:49,858 --> 00:56:52,558
So he says that they are not Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء) only Yusuf(يوسف) was a Nabi(نَبِي)

739
00:56:52,614 --> 00:56:59,086
and Yusuf(يوسف) is the only one out of them who specifically mentioned by name in Qur'an as a Nabi(نَبِي) of Allahسُبحانه وتعالى.

740
00:56:59,683 --> 00:57:04,448
The story of SadyinaYusuf(سَيِّدنا يوسُف) is unique in Qur'an

741
00:57:05,922 --> 00:57:10,542
because the whole story from the beginning to the end was mentioned in one Surah(سورة)

742
00:57:11,854 --> 00:57:15,091
and it takes almost all of the Surah(سورة)

743
00:57:15,670 --> 00:57:21,658
with the exception of a few verses in the beginning and a few verses in the end the whole Surah(سورة) is talking about Sadyina Yusuf(سَيِّدنا يوسُف)

744
00:57:21,951 --> 00:57:31,619
to give us a complete story and experience of a Nabi(نَبِي) of Allahسُبحانه وتعالى from the beginning till the end.

745
00:57:33,618 --> 00:57:40,483
And the story of Yusuf(يوسُف) one of the Salaf(سلف), he says;

746
00:57:40,991 --> 00:57:46,755
Anybody who is going through trouble and problems and is feeling sorrow;

747
00:57:47,136 --> 00:57:50,446
If he reads the Surah(سورة) of Yusuf(يوسُف) it will eliminate it

748
00:57:51,652 --> 00:57:54,924
because it's a story of someone who went through difficulty,

749
00:57:55,757 --> 00:58:05,491
but because he armed himself with Taqwa(تقوى) and Sabr(صبر) righteousness and patience, eventually he was victorious.

750
00:58:07,983 --> 00:58:09,293
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

751
00:58:09,354 --> 00:58:40,621
نَحنُ نَقُصُّ عَلَيكَ أَحسَنَ القَصَصِ بِما أَوحَينا إِلَيكَ هٰذَا القُرآنَ وَإِن كُنتَ مِن قَبلِهِ لَمِنَ الغافِلينَ۝

752
00:58:40,772 --> 00:58:45,346
We relate unto Muhammad(محمد) the best of stories through our revelation on to have this Qur'an

753
00:58:45,552 --> 00:58:49,123
and before this, you were among those who knew nothing about it.

754
00:58:49,362 --> 00:59:18,503
إِذ قالَ يوسُفُ لِأَبيهِ يا أَبَتِ إِنّي رَأَيتُ أَحَدَ عَشَرَ كَوكَبًا وَالشَّمسَ وَالقَمَرَ رَأَيتُهُم لي ساجِدينَ۝

755
00:59:19,067 --> 00:59:20,092
Yusuf( يوسُف) said;

756
00:59:20,688 --> 00:59:22,966
And Yusuf(يوسُف) in English Joseph.

757
00:59:23,516 --> 00:59:29,310
O my father; Verily I saw in a dream 11 stars and the sun and the moon;

758
00:59:29,503 --> 00:59:32,121
I saw them prostrating themselves for me.

759
00:59:33,203 --> 00:59:35,758
Yusuf(يوسُف) was very young at the time he was a child.

760
00:59:37,718 --> 00:59:47,607
He saw this dream 11 planets and the Sun and the Moon are making Sujood(سجود), prostration to him.

761
00:59:48,215 --> 00:59:49,980
So he told his father about this Dream.

762
00:59:50,417 --> 00:59:51,363
His father told him;

763
00:59:51,571 --> 01:00:10,609
قالَ يا بُنَيَّ لا تَقصُص رُؤياكَ عَلىٰ إِخوَتِكَ فَيَكيدوا لَكَ كَيدًا ۖ

764
01:00:11,006 --> 01:00:15,071
Oh my son relate not this vision of yours to your brothers.

765
01:00:15,754 --> 01:00:18,555
He said: Don't tell your brothers about this vision.

766
01:00:18,911 --> 01:00:19,651
Why?

767
01:00:19,920 --> 01:00:22,275
Lest they arrange a plot against you.

768
01:00:23,060 --> 01:00:29,378
The father knew that this dream means that Yusuf(يوسُف) will attain very high levels

769
01:00:30,114 --> 01:00:35,312
and that everyone in his family will be under him

770
01:00:37,407 --> 01:00:41,507
and the father knew that this is something the brothers will not accept

771
01:00:42,864 --> 01:00:48,505
because they were already jealous of Yusuf(يوسُف) and we'll see how bad their jealousy was

772
01:00:49,464 --> 01:00:50,094
and then he said;

773
01:00:50,118 --> 01:01:03,735
إِنَّ الشَّيطانَ لِلإِنسانِ عَدُوٌّ مُبينٌ۝

774
01:01:03,989 --> 01:01:07,157
Verily Satan is an enemy to humans.

775
01:01:08,221 --> 01:01:14,493
Shaytan(شَيْطَانْ) is the one, who places these disputes among us; it is from Shaytan(شَيْطَانْ).

776
01:01:15,156 --> 01:01:16,453
من عمل الشيطان

777
01:01:17,694 --> 01:01:19,321
And Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

778
01:01:19,559 --> 01:01:27,456
وَقُل لِّعِبَادِي يَقُولُوا الَّتِي هِيَ أَحْسَنُ ۚ إِنَّ الشَّيْطَانَ يَنزَغُ بَيْنَهُمْ ۚ إِنَّ الشَّيْطَانَ كَانَ لِلْإِنسَانِ عَدُوًّا مُّبِينًا۝

779
01:01:27,813 --> 01:01:32,375
Tell my servants to say a good word between themselves, say a good word

780
01:01:33,098 --> 01:01:37,577
because Shaytan(شَيْطَانْ) causes problems amongst you because Shaytan(شَيْطَانْ) is your enemy.

781
01:01:38,001 --> 01:01:40,904
Allahسُبحانه وتعالى is telling us, “say good words”.

782
01:01:41,435 --> 01:01:49,619
The good word is a weapon against Shaytan(شَيْطَانْ) because Shaytan(شَيْطَانْ) is using your words against you.

783
01:01:50,151 --> 01:01:52,468
He's using your words to bring problems.

784
01:01:53,055 --> 01:01:56,407
If we look at problems, most of them are caused because of what we say.

785
01:01:57,764 --> 01:01:59,008
So Allahسُبحانه وتعالى says;

786
01:01:59,032 --> 01:02:00,670
وَقُل لِّعِبَادِي يَقُولُوا الَّتِي هِيَ أَحْسَنُ

787
01:02:00,756 --> 01:02:08,344
Say the best always speak the best and that will keep away from you a big part of the plot of Shaytan(شَيْطَانْ).

788
01:02:10,177 --> 01:02:12,724
صَلَّى الله عَلى سَيَّدِنَا محمد وَعَلى اَلِهِ وَ صَحْبِهِ وَسَلِّمْ

